OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786103287
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cafter body found in house
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder after a body was discovered
OL,8,Fin Smethwick.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Police were called to
OL,11,FSouth Road, in the Black Country town,
OL,12,Faround 3.15pm on Thursday, after a
OL,13,Fmember of the public called 999.
OL,15,FThey found the victim, who is
OL,16,Funderstood to be in his 40s, inside a
OL,17,Fproperty and have informed his family.
OL,19,FA 60-year-old man was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of murder and remains in
OL,21,Fcustody.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/3
