OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786103287
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cafter body found in house
OL,6,FA cordon is in place on South Road
OL,7,Ffrom the junctions of Little Moor Hill
OL,8,Fto North Street while detectives carry
OL,9,Fout door-to-door enquiries and gather
OL,10,FCCTV.
OL,12,FWest Midlands Police said: "We've
OL,13,Farrested a man on suspicion of murder
OL,14,Ffollowing the discovery of a body at
OL,15,Fan address on South Road, Smethwick.
OL,17,F"The body was found just before 3.15pm
OL,18,Fyesterday, following a call from a
OL,19,Fmember of the public.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/3
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
