FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786103287
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cafter body found in house
OL,6,F"The family of the man, who was in his
OL,7,F40s, have been informed, and our
OL,8,Fthoughts are with them today.
OL,10,F"A short time later, a man aged 60 was
OL,11,Farrested on suspicion of murder and
OL,12,Fremains in custody today.
OL,14,F"We are carrying out CCTV and house to
OL,15,Fhouse enquiries as we work to
OL,16,Festablish the full circumstances."
